exports[`horse-asterisk-default.md - {"proseWrap":"always"} format 1`] = `
====================================options=====================================
parsers: ["markdown"]
proseWrap: "always"
                                                      printWidth: 80 (default) |
=====================================input======================================
This is _italic_ and this is *also italic*.

A standalone emphasis like _word_ should use asterisks.

But emphasis whose content contains a literal star like *a * b* falls back to underscores.

Nested _emphasis with *inner* span_ keeps asterisks for the inner.

=====================================output=====================================
This is *italic* and this is *also italic*.

A standalone emphasis like *word* should use asterisks.

